{"nodes": [{"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_chapter11", "label": "Chapter 11 \u2014 The single expression", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_six_languages", "label": "\u039b in six languages \u2014 order, algebra, geometry, analysis, information, logic", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_binary_statement", "label": "The seventh statement, in binary \u2014 cells as 17-bit down-set words", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It earns its place by distinguishing what the other six do not: the cells ARE bit-vectors, which makes join and meet machine primitives rather than definitions."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_surplus_707", "label": "Surplus \u2014 17 bits carried against 9.93 needed, 7.07 bits per cell", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_twenty_implications", "label": "The twenty covering relations as twenty implications between bit positions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The twenty implications alone cut 131,072 words to exactly 976, so the surplus is not spare capacity and no bit is removable \u2014 redundancy lives in the implications."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_monotone_circuit", "label": "\u039b\u2088 is a monotone boolean circuit \u2014 depth five, no NOT, no feedback, no memory", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_lambda9_automaton", "label": "\u039b\u2089 is an automaton \u2014 closed under composition, 41,682 pairs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The tower's first step is the step from a decider to a machine, and it was taken to carry seniority."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_generating_function_f", "label": "F \u2014 the multivariate generating function whose coefficient function is \u03c7", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_caterpillar_tree", "label": "The caterpillar \u2014 a path of seven nodes with one pendant at k", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The simplest tree that is not a path, which is why a single left-to-right nesting exists with one bracketed factor; a branching tree would need nested brackets and a cycle would need inclusion\u2013exclusion."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_pauli_coupling", "label": "The one coupling g \u2264 min(q, 4f+2) \u2014 the only non-product term, and it is physics", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Remove it and 976 becomes 1,000; the excluded 24 cells all have three electrons in an s orbital. It is recovered rather than assumed \u2014 \u211b(\u039b) = \u039b rebuilds it from the cells alone."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_detachable_2s", "label": "2S is a leaf, so its factor detaches \u2014 spin multiplicity is algebraically inert", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_rank_polynomial_asymmetry", "label": "The rank polynomial and the asymmetry \u2014 F(\u22121) = 2", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A rank polynomial is palindromic exactly when the poset is self-dual; the tree's coupling of \u2113 to n and f to e stops the vanishing factors appearing free, leaving a residue of 2."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_three_structural_facts", "label": "Why a closed expression exists \u2014 monotone, two-variable, acyclic", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Remove any one and no such expression exists: a sum bound breaks monotonicity (89,864 join failures measured), a three-variable constraint breaks treeness, a cycle returns 2^d inclusion\u2013exclusion terms."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_figure_11_1", "label": "Figure 11.1 \u2014 the constraint graph of \u039b as a caterpillar", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_figure_11_2", "label": "Figure 11.2 \u2014 the rank polynomial read forwards and backwards", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_chapter11", "target": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_six_languages", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_chapter11", "target": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expression_binary_statement", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter11-single-expression.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter11_single_expres